# Technical Requirements: Handl

## Architecture
React, TypeScript and Vite front end with a Node (Express) server for secure API calls.

## Components
- Homepage, LoginScreen, HouseholdFlow, WorkerFlow
- KanpurMap (Google Maps with worker pins)
- JobChatDrawer
- kanpurWorkers.ts (dummy worker data)

## AI
Gemini API reads text, a voice transcript or a photo and returns worker type, urgency and a price range. For scrap photos it lists items and estimates price.

## Maps
Google Maps JavaScript API. The nearest worker is picked by distance. Tracking is simulated. Outside AI Studio, the map needs a billing-enabled Maps key.

## Security
API keys stay in environment variables. Only .env.example is committed.

## Limitations
Simulated OTP and tracking, estimated prices, photo accuracy depends on lighting.

## Deployment
- Google AI Studio: https://handlapp.ai.studio
- Render: https://handl-mxib.onrender.com

